  - Uses auth-derived actor only (`requireActorIdentity`), never request-body actor
  - Added route discovery entry at `packages/server/src/editor/routes.ts:83`

- Added authorship validation + persistence logic in `packages/server/src/editor/service.ts:707`:
  - New `upsertAuthorship(docId, actorId, input)` service method
  - Range validation (`INVALID_AUTHORSHIP_RANGE`) at `packages/server/src/editor/service.ts:268`
  - Author validation against `human|ada|spock|scotty` (`INVALID_AUTHORSHIP_AUTHOR`) via `AUTHORSHIP_ACTORS` at `packages/server/src/editor/service.ts:147`
  - Persists/toggles ranges in SQLite using existing collaboration repository and writes authorship history entries

- Extended stats aggregation to include explicit percentages for required actors in `packages/server/src/editor/service.ts:50` and computation at `packages/server/src/editor/service.ts:421`:
  - `authorshipStats.human`
  - `authorshipStats.ada`
  - `authorshipStats.spock`
